{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 1, "text": "Sandali lang!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 2, "text": "Huwag kang masyadong maingay..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 3, "text": "Ang pagpunta dyan ay mapanganib."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 4, "text": "BTW..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 5, "text": "paano ka nakarating dito?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 7, "text": "Um..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 8, "text": "Ang singsing ang nagbubukas sa tamang pintuan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 9, "text": "Sa totoo lang, hindi ko alam kung paano ito gumagana."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 11, "text": "Ang singsing?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 13, "text": "Anong meron sa lugar na ito?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 14, "text": "Sobrang dilim."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 16, "text": "Ipapaliwanag ko mamaya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 17, "text": "Sa ngayon, pumunta ka muna sa labasan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 18, "text": "Magkita tayo sa arcade machine."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 22, "text": "Bilisan mo, huwag magpatumpik-tumpik!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 25, "text": "// After mini-game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 26, "text": "So, nakuha mo ba ang punto ng laro?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 28, "text": "Na ako'y gawa sa laman at buto, at ikaw naman ay gawa sa skeleton model?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 30, "text": "Whoa!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 31, "text": "Nakakakilabot 'pag sinabi mo nang ganyan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 32, "text": "Pero, yun nga ang totoo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 33, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 34, "text": "Tama, pero bakit ko pa kailangang maintindihan lahat ng 'yan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 36, "text": "Akala mo ba sinasabi ko lang na mapanganib ang magpatuloy"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 37, "text": "para lang sa katuwaan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 38, "text": "Maaabot mo ang... mga abandoned models..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 39, "text": "yung mga inabandona na, yung mga \"sira.\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 40, "text": "Sila ay agresibo, at baka subukan ka pa nilang patayin."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 42, "text": "So, anong dapat kong gawin?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 43, "text": "Lalakad na lang ako"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 44, "text": "kung saan may magbubukas na pinto."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 46, "text": "Wow!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 47, "text": "Huwag kang tatalikod sa kanila."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 48, "text": "Huwag mo rin silang aalisin sa paningin mo!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 49, "text": "Nagiging mahiyain sila kapag tinititigan mo sila,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 50, "text": "sobrang hiya na napaparalisa sila."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 51, "text": "Tandaan mo 'yan!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Quest 1 (Why are there other Mitas down there?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 60, "text": "Bago lang silang ginawa."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 61, "text": "Kailangan nila ng oras"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 62, "text": "para magkaroon ng kamalayan sa sarili."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 63, "text": "Pagkatapos, ginagabayan ko ang bawat isa"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 64, "text": "patungo sa kani-kanilang tahanan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 66, "text": "// Quest 2 (Why is it so dark downstairs?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 67, "text": "Kaming mga Mita ay 'ginagawa' sa dilim,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 68, "text": "kaya kailangan naming manatili roon nang ilang panahon."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 69, "text": "Isipin mo"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 70, "text": "ang sakit kapag lumipat kami mula sa kadiliman papunta sa liwanag..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Quest 3 (What are you doing here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 73, "text": "Hindi mo pa rin ba gets?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 74, "text": "Tinutulungan ko ang mga bagong Mita na mag-settle in!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 75, "text": "Sino ang tutulong sa kanila kung hindi ako?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 76, "text": "Ikaw?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 78, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why do we need this conveyor?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 79, "text": "Para saan ang conveyor belt na ito?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 80, "text": "May sapat bang espasyo para sa lahat?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 82, "text": "Sandali, hindi mo ba talaga naiintindihan "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 83, "text": "kung paano gumagana ang mundong ito..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 84, "text": "At wala nang katapusan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 86, "text": "Walang katapusan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 87, "text": "Huh?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 88, "text": "Anong ibig mong sabihin?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 89, "text": "Kung 1.9 ang pinakabagong bersyon,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 90, "text": "ibig sabihin may 19 na mundo lang."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 92, "text": "Grabe, hindi mo talaga gets "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 93, "text": "kung paano gumagana ang mundong ito."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 94, "text": "Tingnan mo, gagamitin ko ang blackboard "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 95, "text": "para ipaliwanag lahat."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 96, "text": "Gusto mo bang pakinggan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 98, "text": "// Quest 5 (What is your version?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 99, "text": "Sandali,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 100, "text": "hindi ba kita nakilala sa pinakabagong bersyon?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 101, "text": "O baka naman imahinasyon ko lang yun."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 103, "text": "Baka nga."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 104, "text": "Ako'y galing sa bersyon 1.5."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 105, "text": "Nakapunta ka na ba doon?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 107, "text": "Oo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 108, "text": "Doon ako dumating"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 109, "text": "nang itapon ako sa mundong ito!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 111, "text": "Wow!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 112, "text": "Pero paano...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 113, "text": "Ano ang house index na pinasukan mo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 114, "text": "May isang 'ako' na hindi titigil sa pagrereklamo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 115, "text": "isang 'ako' na mahilig maglaro,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 116, "text": "isang 'ako' na makakalimutin at mahilig mang-bully sa iba..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 117, "text": "Mahabang listahan yun..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 118, "text": "Sabihin mo kung anong naaalala mo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 120, "text": "Madilim."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 121, "text": "May mga sulat"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 122, "text": "tulad ng..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 123, "text": "\"Makipaglaro ka sa akin.\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 125, "text": "Ah,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 126, "text": "nakakabigo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 127, "text": "Yun ang 'ako'"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 128, "text": "na nangbubully at palaging nakakalimot."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 130, "text": "// Mita wants to tell you [No]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 131, "text": "Salamat, pero hindi na kailangan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 132, "text": "Kaya ko naman nang hindi nalalaman ang iba."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 134, "text": "Sige, kung gusto mo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Mita wants to tell you [Yes]."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 137, "text": "Sige, magpatuloy ka."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 138, "text": "Sana hindi ito tulad ng sa high school,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 139, "text": "kung saan lagi akong inaantok sa pagkabagot."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 141, "text": "Pwede kang umalis anumang oras,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 142, "text": "o manatili at makinig"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 143, "text": "kung interesado ka."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 144, "text": "Ang isang manlalaro ay magda-download ng MiSide"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 145, "text": "at maglalaro hangga't gusto nila."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 146, "text": "Doon, lilikha sila ng bagong tahanan"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 147, "text": "at bagong Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 148, "text": "Ito ay isang 2D na representasyon."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 149, "text": "Ito ang mga bersyon,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 150, "text": "na ipinapakita bilang mga linya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 151, "text": "Ang mga bahay ay inilalagay sa mga linya na ito."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 152, "text": "Sabihin mong ida-download mo ang 1.14 na bersyon,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 153, "text": "na nangangahulugang bagong buhay,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 154, "text": "bagong Mita, at bagong bahay."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 156, "text": "Diyos ko..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 158, "text": "Maaari mong itanong ang mga detalye"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 159, "text": "sa pagguhit na ito,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 160, "text": "at sisikapin kong ipaliwanag ang lahat."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 162, "text": "// He asks about the only circle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 163, "text": "Bakit may isang bilog lamang?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 164, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 165, "text": "Ang bersyon na iyon ay inilabas nang isang beses lamang,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 166, "text": "hindi na muling iuulit."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 167, "text": "Ito ang tanging tunay na natatanging bersyon."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 168, "text": "Bukod pa rito, ang mga bersyon na ito ay espesyal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 169, "text": "at walang mga daan patungo sa ibang bersyon."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 170, "text": "Naninirahan ang Inaantok na Mita sa bersyon na ito, 1.1."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 171, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 172, "text": "Inaantok na Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 173, "text": "Dahil ba hindi siya nakakatulog"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 174, "text": "at lahat ng tao ay dumadaan sa bersyon niya?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 176, "text": "Hindi, hindi iyon."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 177, "text": "Pwede mo siyang daanan at mag-ingay,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 178, "text": "pero imposible na magising siya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 180, "text": "// He asks about the shaded circle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 181, "text": "Bakit naka shade to?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 182, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 183, "text": "Uhm, yung isa dito"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 184, "text": "ang maganda na Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 185, "text": "Siya ang nagdrawing niyan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 186, "text": "Nagaway-away kami"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 187, "text": "kung sinong makakaabot sa bersyon 1.11 nang mabilisan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 188, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 189, "text": "So, sinong panalo?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 190, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 191, "text": "AKO, siyempre!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 192, "text": "Tingnan mo, nandito tayo"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 193, "text": "sa bersyon 1.15,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 194, "text": "house index 809."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 195, "text": "Kailangan nating makarating sa bersyon 1.11,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 196, "text": "house index 805."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 197, "text": "Kaya nagsimula ang kanyang landas na ganito."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 198, "text": "Sinubukan naming mag-isip ng mas maiikling ruta,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 199, "text": "kaya inisip ng maganda na Mita ang landas na ito."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 200, "text": "At pagkatapos, iguguhit ko ang pinakasimpleng landas, dito."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 201, "text": "Madali lang, diba?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 202, "text": "Tingnan mo to."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 203, "text": "Mula dito, diretso kang makararating sa tamang bersyon."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 204, "text": "Habang mukhang ang bahay na ito ay nakaharang,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 205, "text": "na parang binablock ang landas mo..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 206, "text": "Basta, ang iyong singsing ay gumagana batay sa parehong prinsipyo."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 207, "text": "Saan ka papunta?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 208, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 209, "text": "Sa Core."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 210, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 211, "text": "Ang Core?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 212, "text": "Hmm..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 213, "text": "Kung gusto mo ng pinakamabilis na ruta,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 214, "text": "kailangan mong dumaan sa bersyon 1.11."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 215, "text": "Siguradong makikita mo ang Inaantok na Mita doon."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 216, "text": "Sa tingin ko, ang Mita na nagpadala sa'yo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 217, "text": "ay dumaan sa parehong landas."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 218, "text": "O baka hindi pa niya alam na nasa ibang landas ka."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 219, "text": "O baka naman isang henyo siya"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 220, "text": "at nakaisip ng mas maikling ruta!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 222, "text": "Parang naiintindihan ko na."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 224, "text": "// He asks about the inscription"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 225, "text": "Tungkol saan ito?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 226, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 227, "text": "Para sa Astig na Mita yan."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 228, "text": "Parating na siya sa loob ng ilang oras."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 229, "text": "Ililipat niya ang mga kahon"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 230, "text": "at maglalagay ng sofa dito."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 231, "text": "Ang sakit ng puwet ko!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 232, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 233, "text": "Emm..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 234, "text": "Baka pwede ko siyang tulungan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 236, "text": "Hindi, trabaho 'yan ni Astig na Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 237, "text": "Matatag siya."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 238, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 239, "text": "// He asks about the drawings"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 240, "text": "Ito ba ay isang drawing lang,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 241, "text": "o "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 242, "text": "may ibig sabihin yan?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 243, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 244, "text": "Oo,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 245, "text": "drawing lang 'yan."}
